msgid "Raw Ethernet MAC, MDIO and DP83848"
msgstr "Raw Ethernet MAC、MDIO 与 DP83848"

msgid "This optional mechanism keeps network protocols, tasks, MAC-address policy, negotiation policy, PHY power/reset circuitry and product recovery outside Nexus. Lookup returns immutable Ethernet and MDIO faces; it never starts hardware. The default platform does not instantiate descriptors, buffers, a PHY or a worker. The production owner is `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`; this mode currently targets the exact STM32F407VET6/ZGT6 packages for the reviewed seventeen-pad MII A/B/C route and STM32F407ZGT6 for the existing nine-pad RMII A/C/G route. Family organization does not establish support for every STM32F4 device. Native is an explicitly enabled host model under `tests/support/native/`, not a production SoC."
msgstr "此可选机制将网络协议、任务、MAC 地址策略、协商策略、PHY 供电／复位电路和产品恢复留在 Nexus 外部。查找返回不可变 Ethernet 和 MDIO 接口，不启动硬件。默认平台不实例化 descriptor、缓冲、PHY 或 worker。生产 owner 为 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`；该模式当前针对已审十七引脚 MII A/B/C 路线的精确 STM32F407VET6/ZGT6，以及已有九引脚 RMII A/C/G 路线的 STM32F407ZGT6。按家族组织目录不表示支持每款 STM32F4。Native 是 `tests/support/native/` 下显式启用的主机模型，不是生产 SoC。"

msgid "The selected `raw-mii` or `raw-rmii` mode uses normal four-word chained descriptors, contiguous untagged Ethernet II frames, 14–1514 bytes excluding FCS. Length-coded IEEE 802.3, 802.1Q/802.1ad tags, jumbo frames, checksum offload, PTP and scatter/gather are rejected or remain separate unsupported modes. TX padding and FCS insertion stay in hardware. RX storage has at least 1518 bytes; automatic CRC/pad/type stripping is disabled, so the reported RX descriptor length includes its four-byte FCS. The public loan subtracts exactly four bytes after complete-frame bounds checks. No software claim establishes cable, waveform or throughput qualification."
msgstr "所选 `raw-mii` 或 `raw-rmii` 使用普通四字 chained descriptor、连续无标签 Ethernet II 帧，长度为不含 FCS 的 14–1514 字节。按长度编码的 IEEE 802.3、802.1Q／802.1ad 标签、jumbo、校验卸载、PTP 和 scatter/gather 在此 raw 接口中被拒绝或不受支持。TX padding 和 FCS 插入由硬件承担。RX 存储至少 1518 字节；自动 CRC／pad／type 剥离关闭，因此 RX descriptor 报告长度包含四字节 FCS。公共 loan 在完整帧边界检查后精确减去四字节。软件结果不建立线缆、波形或吞吐资格。"

msgid "MII selects all seventeen AF11 pads, including CRS, COL, RX_ER, RX_CLK and TX_CLK; the explicit pad receipt retains all seventeen bits through refused withdrawal. The external PHY supplies 2.5/25 MHz receive/transmit clocks for 10/100 Mbit/s. RMII instead requires its external 50 MHz reference. Selecting either software route proves no fitted PHY, strap, reset, connector or magnetics. The same physical MAC, selector, DMA, MDIO and drain owner serves both modes. Fresh RCC source/PLL/divider observations must match the selected clock profile before MAC reset; a configured HCLK value alone cannot authorize a changed tree."
msgstr "MII 选择全部十七个 AF11 引脚，包括 CRS、COL、RX_ER、RX_CLK 和 TX_CLK；显式引脚收条在释放被拒绝时保留全部十七位责任。外部 PHY 为 10／100 Mbit/s 提供 2.5／25 MHz 收发时钟。RMII 则要求外部 50 MHz 参考。选择任一软件路线都不证明已安装 PHY、strap、reset、连接器或磁性器件。同一个物理 MAC、选择器、DMA、MDIO 和排空 owner 服务两种模式。MAC reset 前，最新 RCC source／PLL／divider 观测必须匹配所选时钟 profile；仅配置 HCLK 数值不能授权已改变的时钟树。"

msgid "Static storage and data ownership"
msgstr "静态存储与数据所有权"

msgid "Caller assembly supplies exact TX/RX descriptor arrays, TX slots, RX metadata and buffers. No SDK default five-buffer pool or global cursor is linked. The provider validates aligned descriptors, complete Ethernet-bus-master read/write spans, array/control/payload separation and independent buffers before DMA reset or OWN publication. TX payloads need four-byte alignment and may not overlap a request, any provider/control/descriptor/RX storage or another borrowed request. Read-only TX payload sharing is allowed while every corresponding borrow lives. The current F407 binding accepts reviewed main SRAM only: 128 KiB at 0x20000000. CCM is excluded. CPU reachability or a SPI DMA selector does not establish Ethernet reachability."
msgstr "调用方装配提供精确 TX／RX 描述符数组、TX slot、RX 元数据和 buffer，不链接 SDK 默认五 buffer 池或全局游标。provider 在 DMA reset 或发布 OWN 前，检查描述符对齐、Ethernet bus master 完整读写范围、数组／控制／负载分离和独立 buffer。TX 负载需要四字节对齐，不得覆盖 request、任何 provider／控制／描述符／RX 存储或另一借用 request。全部对应借用持续有效时允许共享只读 TX 负载。当前 F407 绑定只接纳受审主 SRAM：0x20000000 起的 128 KiB，排除 CCM。CPU 可达或 SPI DMA selector 不证明 Ethernet 可达。"

msgid "A TX request is borrowed only after all validation and atomic admission. Buffer, length and chained pointer are written before DMB and OWN. Normal completion requires a CPU-owned last/first single-frame descriptor with its DMA-written TX status. RM0090 specifies that the last descriptor receives MAC transmit status before ownership returns. The buffer/control reference is cleared, DSB executes, the provider slot is detached and only then SETTLED is release-published. Success reports the submitted bytes transmitted by the MAC, not delivery to a peer application. Returned error status reports IO; no request is retried."
msgstr "TX request 仅在全部校验及原子接纳后借用。先写 buffer、长度和链指针，再执行 DMB 和 OWN。正常完成要求 CPU 持有末／首单帧描述符，且含 DMA 写入的 TX 状态。RM0090 规定最后描述符在返还所有权前接收 MAC 发送状态。清除 buffer／控制引用、执行 DSB、分离 provider slot 后，才 release-publish SETTLED。成功表示 MAC 发出了提交的字节，不证明对端应用已收到。硬件错误返回 IO，不重试 request。"

msgid "Each RX descriptor has DMA, READY or HELD metadata and a monotonically increasing 64-bit incarnation. One complete descriptor is published only after OWN returned and an acquire barrier. READY slots form a caller-metadata FIFO: enqueue, acquire and matching release are constant-time and never scan a variable ring under the mask. A held descriptor remains CPU-owned at ring wrap. No copy pool or overwrite can satisfy backpressure. CRC, length, fragmented, tagged/unsupported and other DMA error frames are discarded with latched flags and saturating discard counts. RBU/overflow observations are visible separately; they do not invent an exact lost-frame count. A stale, foreign or double token cannot rearm a buffer. Epochs survive a successful stop/restart; exhaustion closes admission rather than wraps."
msgstr "每个 RX 描述符有 DMA、READY、HELD 元数据与单调 64 位 incarnation。OWN 返回并执行 acquire 屏障后才发布完整描述符。READY 槽组成调用方元数据 FIFO，enqueue、acquire 和匹配 release 为常数时间，不在掩码内扫描变长环。借出的描述符在环回绕时仍归 CPU。复制池或覆盖不能替代背压。CRC、长度、分片、标签／不支持及其他 DMA 错误帧丢弃并锁存标志和饱和丢弃计数；RBU／overflow 另行观察，不虚构精确丢帧数。旧、外来或重复 token 不能重新装填缓冲。Epoch 跨成功 stop/restart 保留，耗尽关闭准入而非回绕。"

msgid "IRQ, cancellation and stop"
msgstr "IRQ、取消与停止"

msgid "The ISR processes at most one TX and one RX descriptor. Coalesced completions repend the selected actual vector when another CPU-owned completed descriptor is ready. Hardware and descriptor accesses are direct volatile loads/stores on the MCU, with no per-register operations table. Optional cold callbacks handle NVIC source control, repending and current-priority validation, rather than payload bytes. The wake is a bounded IRQ-only hint; task service does not invoke it. Its actual current priority/group must satisfy the configured kernel ceiling. A captured wake stays borrowed until its callback returns. Attach/stop reports BUSY while a publisher exists; a callback cannot release its own live context."
msgstr "ISR 最多处理一个 TX 和一个 RX 描述符。如果另一个 CPU-owned 已完成描述符可用，合并完成会重新 pending 所选实际向量。MCU 硬件及描述符直接 volatile 读写，无逐寄存器方法表。可选冷态回调处理 NVIC 源控制、重新 pending 与当前优先级校验，不处理 payload 字节。Wake 是有界仅 IRQ 提示，任务 service 不调用它；实际当前 priority/group 必须满足配置内核 ceiling。已捕获 wake 在回调返回前保持借用。存在发布者时 attach/stop 返回 BUSY；回调不能释放自身活动 context。"

msgid "One serialized privileged task owns control methods, with incoming masks clear. Metadata guards save/restore the incoming PRIMASK. No task, RTOS lock or worker is created. Consumers process their loan outside those short guards. Cold storage validation can scale with descriptor count; it runs before hardware acquisition."
msgstr "唯一串行特权任务持有控制方法，进入掩码全清。元数据 guard 保存／恢复进入 PRIMASK，不建立任务、RTOS 锁或 worker。消费者在短 guard 外处理借用。冷态存储校验可随描述符数量增长，但运行在硬件取得之前。"

msgid "Cancellation closes the shared TX engine and is explicitly controller-wide. Other pending TX requests are cancelled too; an already returned successful wire status remains success. Changing speed/duplex requires the external owner to apply link-down first, then observe both DMA processes and MAC/FIFO state idle before applying the new up fact. Until then BUSY preserves the old mode; an unchanged up fact is idempotent. Restarting drained TX in the same mode does not require discarding live RX. This follows the independent process and MAC enable semantics in RM0090 §33.6.1/§33.8. Link-down and fatal DMA/underflow errors close admission and report IO without replay. Task service advances absolute request and drain deadlines. Cancel/timeout alone never revoke request or payload ownership."
msgstr "取消关闭共享 TX 引擎，明确影响整个控制器，其他 pending TX 请求也被取消；已返回的成功线上状态仍保留成功。改变速率／双工前，外部 owner 先应用 link-down，再观察两个 DMA 进程及 MAC／FIFO 均空闲，随后应用新 up 事实。此前 BUSY 保留旧模式；相同 up 事实幂等。同模式重启已排空 TX 不必丢弃活动 RX，依据 RM0090 §33.6.1／§33.8 的独立进程和 MAC enable 语义。link-down 及致命 DMA／underflow 错误关闭接纳并返回 IO，不重放。任务 service 推进绝对 request 和 drain deadline。仅 cancel／timeout 不撤销 request 或负载所有权。"

msgid "Withdrawal clears DMA ST and MAC TE, reads their actual state, requires TX process state stopped, issues TX FIFO flush and observes its self-clearing acknowledgement and inactive MAC/FIFO state. Only then may software withdraw an unexecuted OWN bit; the descriptor is read back before references detach. A refused OWN, running engine or stuck FIFO flush retains QUARANTINED requests when drain expires. Later actual quiescence may settle them, but cannot invent a successful transfer."
msgstr "撤销清除 DMA ST 与 MAC TE，读取真实状态，要求 TX process 停止，发出 TX FIFO flush 并观察自清确认及 MAC/FIFO 非活动。然后才可软件撤销未执行 OWN，并在解除引用前读回描述符。OWN 拒绝、引擎仍运行或 FIFO flush 卡住时，排空超时保留 QUARANTINED 请求。后续真实静止可完成并排空它们，但不能虚构成功传输。"

msgid "Stop additionally closes RX/MAC/DMA admission and sources, requires RX process state stopped and no active MAC receive path, checks MDIO/reset idle and DMA interrupt-disable readback, detaches and clears the selected NVIC source, then withdraws RX OWN with readback. It clears descriptor base pointers and W1C status and checks those writes before releasing wake/storage ownership. Held consumer loans prevent successful stop and remain immutable. Callers join all task/IRQ publishers and consumers before reclaiming assembly storage or Board clocks/pins. Partial startup owns its residual effects and must use this same explicit stop; a reset/IRQ-enable failure is never replaced with successful cleanup fiction."
msgstr "Stop 额外关闭 RX/MAC/DMA 准入和源，要求 RX process 停止、MAC 接收路径无活动，检查 MDIO/reset idle 和 DMA interrupt-disable 读回，detach 并清除所选 NVIC 源，再撤销且读回 RX OWN。解除 wake／storage 所有权前清描述符基址与 W1C 状态并校验写入。Consumer 持有的借用禁止 stop 成功且保持不可变。回收装配存储或 Board 时钟／引脚前，调用者 join 全部 task／IRQ 发布者与消费者。部分启动持有残余效果，必须使用同一显式 stop；reset／IRQ-enable 失败绝不替换为虚构清理成功。"

msgid "Station management and PHY facts"
msgstr "站点管理与 PHY 事实"

msgid "Clause22 MDIO is a narrow, separate face using the same explicitly owned MAC clock. Addresses/registers are 0..31. Operations run only in privileged task context with masks clear, never wait in IRQ/PRIMASK and require a finite absolute monotonic deadline. The divider comes from actual HCLK: the maintained F407 profile uses 168 MHz and HCLK/102, below 2.5 MHz. BUSY rejects without another command. Timeout leaves the real hardware state intact and does not publish a late read value; a timed-out write may already have applied and must not be blindly replayed."
msgstr "Clause22 MDIO 是窄且独立的 face，共用明确拥有的 MAC 时钟。地址和寄存器为 0..31。只在掩码清零的特权任务上下文执行，不在 IRQ／PRIMASK 中等待，并要求有限绝对单调 deadline。分频取实际 HCLK：当前 F407 profile 使用 168 MHz 和 HCLK/102，低于 2.5 MHz。BUSY 拒绝，不另发命令。超时保留真实硬件状态，不发布迟到读值；已超时写入可能已经生效，不可盲目重放。"

msgid "DP83848 state contains an explicit address and expected model ID. TI 0x20005ca0 and NS 0x20005c90 variants are selected explicitly; only the revision nibble is ignored. No unknown ID falls back to a supported PHY. BMCR soft reset observes the actual self-clearing bit under the same deadline and invalidates configured truth. It restraps the PHY but proves neither GPIO/power reset nor fitted straps. Products select either explicit 10/100 half/full advertisement or fixed speed and duplex. Configuration success starts negotiation; it does not assert link. Observation reads latch-low BMSR twice plus PHYSTS and reports link only after valid link and, when selected, complete negotiation. Remote fault, loopback/reset or inconsistent fixed mode is not converted to successful link."
msgstr "DP83848 状态包含显式地址和预期型号 ID，显式选择 TI 0x20005ca0 或 NS 0x20005c90，只忽略 revision nibble。未知 ID 不回退为支持 PHY。BMCR 软复位在同一 deadline 下观察实际自清位并作废已配置事实；它重新读取 straps，但不证明 GPIO／电源 reset 或已装 straps。产品选择显式 10/100 半／全双工广告或固定 speed/duplex。配置成功启动协商，不宣称 link。观察两次读取 latch-low BMSR 加 PHYSTS；只有有效 link 且所选协商完成才报告 link。Remote fault、loopback/reset 或固定模式不一致不转换为 link 成功。"

msgid "Reviewed sources and qualification limits"
msgstr "已审来源与资格限制"

msgid "Production layout/mask assertions use the locked ST CMSIS device headers in `vendors/st/cmsis_device_f4/`. Mechanism review uses ST RM0090 Rev22, Ethernet normal descriptors, TxDMA default flow and DMA process-state/FIFO controls. The first four descriptor words and all registers used by this mechanism match those definitions; enhanced descriptor/PTP mode remains disabled in the raw face."
msgstr "生产布局／mask 断言使用锁定 `vendors/st/cmsis_device_f4/` 的 ST CMSIS 器件头。机制审查依据 ST RM0090 Rev22、Ethernet 普通描述符、TxDMA 默认流程和 DMA 进程状态／FIFO 控制。前四个描述符字及该机制使用的寄存器均匹配这些定义；raw face 仍关闭增强描述符／PTP 模式。"

msgid "DP83848 register truth comes from TI SNLS266E (March2015), Tables6-9/10/11/12/13/18 and https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/dp83848c.pdf. The documented TI model/revision is 0x20005ca2. The explicit TI and NS ID distinction is independently confirmed by Linux v6.12 drivers/net/phy/dp83848.c; that GPL source is review evidence only and is not linked or copied into the production component."
msgstr "DP83848 寄存器事实来自 TI SNLS266E（March2015）表 6-9/10/11/12/13/18 和 https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/dp83848c.pdf。文档中 TI 型号／revision 是 0x20005ca2。Linux v6.12 drivers/net/phy/dp83848.c 独立确认 TI 与 NS ID 区别；该 GPL 源仅用于审阅证据，不链接或复制到生产组件。"

msgid "The Qiming F407ZG optional RMII source profile is reviewed separately: manual printed31/physical33 and fixed BSP blob a35e981e8a549e1dbaf84bb4522b2f150bc5d51c show DP83848 address1, an external 50 MHz oscillator and P5/WiFi jumpers; pins PA1/2/7, PC1/4/5, PG11/13/14 AF11. PG routes do not authorize the VE100 package. PHY reset GPIO is unproved. The canonical ARM fixture uses the explicit software pin contract in `tests/contracts/ethernet_assembly/stm32-zg-board/`; it does not qualify an assembled PCB. Sky, the ZG core board and Qiming V4.1 do not inherit this V3.1 PHY route. In particular, V4.1 oscillator, PHY address and connector ambiguities remain recorded Board unknowns. Products must admit their own reviewed route and electrical handoff before enabling hardware."
msgstr "启明 F407ZG 可选 RMII 来源配置独立审查：手册 printed31/physical33 和固定 BSP blob a35e981e8a549e1dbaf84bb4522b2f150bc5d51c 给出 DP83848 地址1、外部 50 MHz 振荡器、P5／WiFi 跳帽，以及 PA1/2/7、PC1/4/5、PG11/13/14 AF11。PG 路线不授权 VE100 封装。PHY reset GPIO 未证实。标准 ARM fixture 使用 `tests/contracts/ethernet_assembly/stm32-zg-board/` 中的显式软件引脚合同，不建立已组装 PCB 资格。天空星、ZG 核心板及启明 V4.1 不继承 V3.1 PHY 路线；V4.1 晶振、PHY 地址和连接器歧义继续作为 Board 未知项记录。产品必须先准入自己的受审路线和电气交接，再启用硬件。"

msgid "The F4 binding is `soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ethernet.c`; its MAC engine is in `soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/legacy_mac/`. GoogleTest/GoogleMock tests execute that mechanism, the SDK-checked F407 binding and explicit Native ingress/egress/MDIO models in `tests/support/native/drivers/`, including W1C and stuck reset/engine/OWN/FIFO/IRQ sources. Native hardware uses caller PHY register files, synthetic FCS storage and explicit descriptor-completion injection; it never invents PHY identity, link, real CRC or remote delivery. Host software, strict ARM compilation, linked image resources and physical/HIL are separate evidence. The first three establish only their recorded scope. Physical PHY/link/electrical, actual PCB jumpers, loss under traffic, latency, throughput and EMC are not executed in this environment. Historical reports that also covered retired families retain their original source identities and bytes; their totals are not current F4 acceptance results."
msgstr "F4 绑定为 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ethernet.c`，MAC 引擎在 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/legacy_mac/`。GoogleTest／GoogleMock 执行该机制、经 SDK 核对的 F407 绑定及 `tests/support/native/drivers/` 中显式 Native 收发／MDIO 模型，包括 W1C 和卡死 reset／engine／OWN／FIFO／IRQ 源。Native 硬件使用调用者 PHY 寄存器文件、合成 FCS 存储和显式描述符完成注入，不虚构 PHY 身份、链路、真实 CRC 或远端送达。主机软件、严格 ARM 编译、链接资源和物理／HIL 分别取证，前三者只建立其执行范围。此环境未执行真实 PHY／链路／电气、PCB 跳帽、流量丢失、延迟、吞吐或 EMC。曾覆盖退役系列的历史报告保留原源码身份与字节，其总数不是当前 F4 验收结果。"

msgid "Independent review regressions protect the known immutable wake-target span against descriptors, RX DMA buffers, request metadata and writable API outputs. Opaque callback-context size remains an external lifetime contract. Wake replacement rechecks in-flight publishers under the same exclusion as replacing the pointer. Stop rechecks publishers after actual NVIC withdrawal and closes IRQ dispatch before unmasked ring/table cleanup; failed cleanup retains the controller. Closing rejects new RX acquire; existing held loans still release."
msgstr "独立审查回归保护已知不可变 wake-target 范围，防止它与描述符、RX DMA 缓冲、请求元数据及可写 API 输出重叠。不透明 callback-context 大小仍由外部生命周期合同负责。Wake 替换在更换指针的同一排他下复核活动发布者。Stop 在真实 NVIC 撤销后再检查发布者，并在未屏蔽的 ring/table 清理前关闭 IRQ dispatch；清理失败保留控制器。Closing 拒绝新 RX acquire，但既有借出块仍可 release。"
